1
00:00:00,784 --> 00:00:04,114
(Amy:)That was great. Rub my chest again.

2
00:00:05,589 --> 00:00:07,619
(Sheldon:)No. I need to get you down for a nap.

3
00:00:07,825 --> 00:00:11,455
(Sheldon:)And for some reason,
that VapoRub gets you all fired up.

4
00:00:14,064 --> 00:00:17,864
- How's the poor thing?
- I'm hanging in there. Thanks for asking.

5
00:00:19,303 --> 00:00:22,463
Hey, Amy, I brought you some drugs
we've been working on in the lab.

6
00:00:22,673 --> 00:00:24,663
(Bernadette:)This is proving really good for congestion.

7
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:27,275
There's a chance
it can make tears burn like acid.

8
00:00:27,478 --> 00:00:29,468
(Bernadette:)So if you take it, happy thoughts.

9
00:00:31,482 --> 00:00:33,852
I'm gonna draw you a soothing bath.

10
00:00:34,084 --> 00:00:37,454
(Sheldon:)- Where's your bath thermometer?
- I don't have a bath thermometer.

11
00:00:37,654 --> 00:00:39,484
(Sheldon:)Fine, then I'm going to draw you...

12
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:43,180
(Sheldon:)...a nerve-wracking bath
of indeterminate temperature.

13
00:00:44,728 --> 00:00:46,318
(Bernadette:)This is a really good expectorant.

14
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:51,130
(Bernadette:)Although, some test subjects reported lactating
uncontrollably when they heard music.

15
00:00:52,336 --> 00:00:55,826
(Amy:)Okay, okay, here's the deal.
I don't need your medicine. I'm not sick.

16
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,830
- I don't understand.
- I got better two days ago.

17
00:00:59,676 --> 00:01:02,406
(Amy:)It's just been so nice
having Sheldon take care of me.

